    "body": "## Motivation\n\nThe `bucket` policy (prefill chosen by prompt length, boundaries rebalanced by character load) is implemented and wired\nfor PD prefill, and the Python launcher accepts it, but the standalone Rust binary's `--policy`, `--prefill-policy` and\n`--decode-policy` reject it.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Add `bucket` to the three value parsers and map it in `parse_policy`.\n- Add `--bucket-adjust-interval-secs` (default 5, as in the Python launcher); `bucket` also takes\n  `--balance-abs-threshold` / `--balance-rel-threshold`, as in the Python launcher.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nRouting-only change. End to end: 2P1D (DeepSeek-V4-Flash, 8x MI308X) behind\n`--pd-disaggregation --prefill-policy bucket --decode-policy round_robin`: requests spread over both prefill servers,\ngsm8k 200 0.93, 0 router errors.\n\nUnit test in `src/main.rs`: `--prefill-policy bucket --bucket-adjust-interval-secs 7` yields `PolicyConfig::Bucket`\nwith interval 7. `cargo +nightly fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings` and\n`cargo test` pass.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nN/A.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #40445162143](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40445162143)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40445162076](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40445162076)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
